<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmez votre compte - ECP</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f9178 0%, #0d7a65 100%);
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .email-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 10%, transparent 10%);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
            animation: moveBackground 20s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes moveBackground {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            100% { transform: translate(30px, 30px); }
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .logo span {
            display: inline-block;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .logo span:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.1s;
        }
        .logo span:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        }
        .tagline {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 50px 40px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .welcome-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5); }
        }
        .welcome-icon svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            fill: white;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .message-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4 0%, #dcfce7 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
        }
        .message-box p {
            color: #065f46;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 45px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            display: block;
            width: fit-content;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .cta-button::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s;
        }
        .cta-button:hover::before {
            left: 100%;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5);
        }
        .cta-button span {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .expiry-notice {
            background: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #92400e;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .expiry-notice::before {
            content: '⏱️';
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 35px 0;
        }
        .feature {
            background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .feature:hover {
            border-color: #10b981;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature h3 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .feature p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 35px 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .footer-divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .footer-text {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .footer-links {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer-links a {
            color: #10b981;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: #059669;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .social-links {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .social-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 6px;
            line-height: 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .social-links a:hover {
            background: #10b981;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .disclaimer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-body {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .logo {
                font-size: 36px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="logo">
                <span>E</span><span>C</span><span>P</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tagline">Emballé c'est pesé - Bio-nettoyage professionnel</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <div class="welcome-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41L9 16.17z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <h1>Bienvenue chez ECP !</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Votre compte est presque prêt... Il ne reste qu'une dernière étape</p>

            <div class="message-box">
                <p>
                    Nous sommes ravis de vous accueillir dans notre communauté de passionnés du jardinage écologique.
                    Pour profiter pleinement de nos produits bio et de nos services discrets, veuillez confirmer votre adresse email.
                </p>
            </div>

            <a href="{{ signedUrl|raw }}" class="cta-button">
                <span>✓ Confirmer mon email</span>
            </a>

            <div class="expiry-notice">
                <div>
                    <strong>Attention :</strong> Ce lien expirera {{ expiresAtMessageKey|trans(expiresAtMessageData, 'VerifyEmailBundle') }}.
                    N'attendez pas pour activer votre compte !
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🌱</div>
                    <h3>Produits Bio</h3>
                    <p>100% naturels et efficaces</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📦</div>
                    <h3>Livraison Discrète</h3>
                    <p>Colis neutre en 48h</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
                    <h3>Paiement Sécurisé</h3>
                    <p>Vos données protégées</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">💚</div>
                    <h3>Support 24/7</h3>
                    <p>Équipe à votre écoute</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <div class="footer-divider"></div>

            <p class="footer-text">
                Vous recevez cet email car vous avez créé un compte sur notre site.<br>
                Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette inscription, vous pouvez ignorer ce message en toute sécurité.
            </p>

            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#">Boutique</a> •
                <a href="#">Politique de confidentialité</a> •
                <a href="#">Nous contacter</a>
            </div>

            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#">📘</a>
                <a href="#">📷</a>
                <a href="#">🐦</a>
                <a href="#">📧</a>
            </div>

            <p class="disclaimer">
                ECP - Emballé c'est pesé • Bio-nettoyage professionnel<br>
                Jardinage écologique et solutions naturelles depuis 2025<br>
                © {{ "now"|date('Y') }} ECP. Tous droits réservés.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
